      <div class="step"><span class="n">1</span><div><h4>Scope</h4><p>In a real engagement: one enquiry type, start to finish, six weeks. Not the sales conversation, not pricing, not the care assessment.</p></div></div>
      <div class="step"><span class="n">2</span><div><h4>Access</h4><p>Published pack material and the field names that mark stated worry, region preference and any care or bereavement language. No health information. No resident records.</p></div></div>
