  <div class="narrow rise" style="margin-top:76px">
    <div class="eyebrow">Before you decide</div><h2>What a pilot actually asks of you.</h2>
    <p class="kicker">Written out in full, because the honest version of this is short and most of it is your time, not your money.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="needs rise">
